the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    is employed; scenario element.
    the annual income is *a number*; scenario element.
    the applicant name is *a text*; scenario element.
    the calculate tax for *a number* is *a second number*; scenario element.
    the tax on income is *a number*.
    the age is *a number*; scenario element.
    has valid license; scenario element.
    can drive.
    the applicant age is *a number*; scenario element.
    the years of residence is *a number*; scenario element.
    has criminal record; scenario element.
    is eligible for benefit.

the knowledge base assume_example includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/assume-example.l4".

the tax on income is a number if
    the annual income is a second number
    and the calculate tax for the second number is the number.

can drive if
    the age is a number N
    and N >= 16
    and has valid license.

is eligible for benefit if
    the applicant age is a number N
    and N >= 21
    and the years of residence is a number M
    and M >= 5
    and it is not the case that has criminal record.

